                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We're paying a trillion dollars just to service our national debt, which is more than we spend on all of defense, more than we spend in Medicare benefits.\n\nThis moment calls for us to do so much more because that \u201cbusiness as usual\u201d approach has left us with this mountain of World War levels of debt and deficits, and it's going to require unprecedented strength, courage of conviction, and political will to take it head on.",
