                "quoted_status_profile_username": "FoxNews",
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In February, I was proud to join @RepRalphNorman in filing an amicus brief in Medina v. Planned Parenthood, supporting South Carolina\u2019s determination that Planned Parenthood does not qualify to receive Medicaid funding.\n\nI\u2019m pleased to see that the Supreme Court rightfully ruled taxpayers of pro-life states should not be forced to fund the abortion industry through government healthcare. All life is a gift from God and deserves the unalienable right to life, liberty, and the pursuit of happiness - I will never stop fighting for the unborn.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "RepRalphNorman"
