                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPad",
                "text": "Democrats voted AGAINST removing illegal aliens from Medicaid.\n\nFor Dems, their opposition to the OBBBA has never been about kicking Americans off of welfare.  \n\nThey are fighting to preserve an open border, defacto amnesty, and tax dollars flowing to illegals.\n\nThey just can\u2019t help themselves.",
